6	//!
7	//! Wire format (little-endian throughout):
8	//!
9	//! - 8 bytes: magic `MLPLPETS`
10	//! - 4 bytes: version u32 (currently 1)
11	//! - 4 bytes: N (count) u32 -- expected 200
12	//! - 4 bytes: C (channels) u32 -- expected 3
13	//! - 4 bytes: H (height) u32 -- expected 64
